<pre class="what-is__example-code"><code><span class="sx-fm">---
format: https://specscore.md/feature-specification
status: Approved
---</span>

<span class="sx-h1"># Feature: Apply Discount</span>

<span class="sx-bold">**Status:**</span> Approved
<span class="sx-bold">**Source Ideas:**</span> discount-codes

<span class="sx-h2">## Summary</span>

A registered user can apply one valid discount code to
their cart at checkout.

<span class="sx-h2">## Problem</span>

Returning customers hold promo codes but cannot redeem
them at checkout, so support applies discounts by hand.

<span class="sx-h2">## Behavior</span>

<span class="sx-h3">### Single code per cart</span>

<span class="sx-h3">#### REQ: one-code-per-cart</span>

The cart MUST hold at most one discount code at a time.
Applying a second code MUST replace the first.

<span class="sx-h3">### Code validity</span>

<span class="sx-h3">#### REQ: code-time-window</span>

The system MUST accept a code only while <span class="sx-tick">`valid_from`</span> &lt;=
now &lt;= <span class="sx-tick">`valid_until`</span>.

<span class="sx-h2">## Acceptance Criteria</span>

<span class="sx-h3">### AC: second-code-replaces-first (verifies REQ:one-code-per-cart)</span>

<span class="sx-bold">**Given**</span> a cart with code <span class="sx-tick">`SAVE20`</span> applied
<span class="sx-bold">**When**</span> the user applies code <span class="sx-tick">`SAVE10`</span>
<span class="sx-bold">**Then**</span> the cart shows only <span class="sx-tick">`SAVE10`</span> and a confirmation

<span class="sx-h3">### AC: expired-code-rejected (verifies REQ:code-time-window)</span>

<span class="sx-bold">**Given**</span> a code whose <span class="sx-tick">`valid_until`</span> is yesterday
<span class="sx-bold">**When**</span> the user applies it
<span class="sx-bold">**Then**</span> the total is unchanged and "This code has expired" shows

<span class="sx-h2">## Open Questions</span>

None at this time.

<span class="sx-fm">---</span>
<span class="sx-fm">*This document follows the https://specscore.md/feature-specification*</span></code></pre>
